            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.57

- Fixed one track producing two artwork transitions after a swipe or direct queue jump.
- Kept the committed queue-track identity alive while Chrome delivers delayed playback metadata.
- Recognized separately decoded copies of the same cover so artwork never animates over itself.
]]></description>
